WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.639 --> 00:00:05.017
Just left Iran a couple days ago.

00:00:05.411 --> 00:00:07.023
A very interesting trip.

00:00:07.023 --> 00:00:09.878
Usually my content is about
uplifting human stories

00:00:09.878 --> 00:00:12.102
and I will make a great video on Iran.

00:00:12.102 --> 00:00:13.139
[inhales deeply]

00:00:13.139 --> 00:00:18.185
But I'm compelled to tell the story of
what's going on right now on the ground

00:00:18.185 --> 00:00:19.385
with sanctions.

00:00:19.642 --> 00:00:20.642
And so...

00:00:21.144 --> 00:00:25.353
I have an interesting perspective
on the country because I'm an American guy

00:00:25.353 --> 00:00:28.233
but I traveled there as an Italian,
I have two passports.

00:00:28.234 --> 00:00:30.866
And so Americans have to go
on a government minded tour

00:00:32.018 --> 00:00:34.897
with an official
and they can't go off on their own.

00:00:34.897 --> 00:00:37.218
I have the privilege
because of my Italian passport

00:00:37.218 --> 00:00:38.944
to be able to travel wherever.

00:00:38.944 --> 00:00:39.944
So here's what I saw.

00:00:40.526 --> 00:00:42.265
I was there three years ago

00:00:42.265 --> 00:00:47.742
and the feeling,
especially in Tehran is very different.

00:00:47.742 --> 00:00:49.182
So these sanctions

00:00:49.655 --> 00:00:51.418
are really pinching the place

00:00:51.418 --> 00:00:53.769
and you hear John Bolton talk about...

00:00:53.769 --> 00:00:56.131
[John Bolton] Do everything we can
to squeeze Iran hard.

00:00:56.131 --> 00:01:00.749
As the British say, to squeeze them
until the pips squeak.

00:01:00.749 --> 00:01:02.879
And we're gonna do everything we can...

00:01:03.006 --> 00:01:05.906
PETER: They want to bring
oil revenue to zero.

00:01:05.968 --> 00:01:08.939
Oil revenue makes up
80% of the tax base in Iran.

00:01:08.939 --> 00:01:13.382
[John Bolton] The Rial, the currency
has declined by 70% since the sanctions.

00:01:13.382 --> 00:01:14.813
Inflation has quadrupled.

00:01:14.813 --> 00:01:17.070
The country is in recession,
you're seeing...

00:01:17.070 --> 00:01:19.954
PETER: And all these
so-called accomplishments

00:01:19.954 --> 00:01:21.728
of how you're crippling a country

00:01:21.728 --> 00:01:23.661
and that all sounds great geopolitically.

00:01:23.661 --> 00:01:25.587
Like I'm gonna lose...

00:01:26.463 --> 00:01:29.923
I'm gonna lose my pawn to gain a knight.

00:01:30.480 --> 00:01:32.861
But the reality is

00:01:33.793 --> 00:01:35.473
on the ground in Iran

00:01:36.553 --> 00:01:39.420
especially in Tehran,
people are feeling it.

00:01:39.420 --> 00:01:41.959
They're feeling it with their jobs

00:01:42.222 --> 00:01:44.456
with being able to support their children.

00:01:44.456 --> 00:01:48.144
So you have middle class,
now a lot of them going down.

00:01:48.618 --> 00:01:50.366
Many ending up on the streets.

00:01:50.366 --> 00:01:51.538
You have a sadness.

00:01:51.538 --> 00:01:54.230
There's overall, like,
there's a sadness in people

00:01:54.230 --> 00:01:57.898
and that energy sort of
takes an inertia and compiles.

00:01:57.898 --> 00:02:00.645
So you feel like this malaise in Tehran.

00:02:00.645 --> 00:02:02.276
I don't want to paint it as all terrible.

00:02:02.276 --> 00:02:04.896
There's people smiling
and living their lives

00:02:04.896 --> 00:02:08.096
and not everyone's suffering
but a lot of people...

00:02:08.800 --> 00:02:10.043
Their lives are going downhill.

00:02:10.043 --> 00:02:13.634
Every young person wants out.

00:02:14.172 --> 00:02:15.692
[people chattering]

00:02:16.510 --> 00:02:21.366
Like how much has
the price of chicken gone up let's say?

00:02:22.174 --> 00:02:23.294
50%

00:02:23.579 --> 00:02:26.086
Depression medication,
I was told by a pharmacist

00:02:26.086 --> 00:02:28.952
50% of the population
is on depression meds.

00:02:29.048 --> 00:02:30.781
Food costs have, at the low end

00:02:30.781 --> 00:02:32.583
I've heard, doubled
in the last five months.

00:02:32.583 --> 00:02:35.071
At the high end, I've heard quadrupled.

00:02:35.071 --> 00:02:38.431
So these successes with sanctions...

00:02:38.974 --> 00:02:41.433
You're crippling a country, great.

00:02:41.433 --> 00:02:42.503
But who suffers?

00:02:42.503 --> 00:02:45.002
Not the politicians,
and they never do, right?

00:02:45.002 --> 00:02:47.802
It's the politicians with coffers of money

00:02:48.352 --> 00:02:50.218
but who suffers out of this?

00:02:50.591 --> 00:02:51.591
Iranians.

00:02:52.002 --> 00:02:58.412
The irony is this is probably the most
pro-American country on the planet.

00:02:58.412 --> 00:03:00.058
As far as like pro-American people.

00:03:00.058 --> 00:03:01.738
When I say I'm Italian

00:03:02.090 --> 00:03:04.588
people are cool, they're like,
"Wow cool, Italy, great.

00:03:04.588 --> 00:03:06.522
When I say American it's like

00:03:06.522 --> 00:03:07.522
[woosh]

00:03:07.522 --> 00:03:08.522
Way up here.

00:03:09.039 --> 00:03:10.039
It's crazy.

00:03:10.517 --> 00:03:13.404
And they're getting
pinched hard by their government.

00:03:13.404 --> 00:03:16.673
They're getting pinched hard
by the US government

00:03:17.249 --> 00:03:18.249
and

00:03:19.058 --> 00:03:22.177
[scoffs] it breaks my heart
because this is...

00:03:22.755 --> 00:03:28.914
This is one of the most hospitable,
open cultures on planet earth

00:03:29.627 --> 00:03:31.185
and they're taking it from all ends.

00:03:32.163 --> 00:03:34.083
And so I just want to
bring awareness to this.

00:03:34.083 --> 00:03:35.385
I just want to shout this out

00:03:35.385 --> 00:03:38.096
because people cannot
understand this unless...

00:03:38.096 --> 00:03:40.715
Well they can understand it the most
when they live through it.

00:03:40.715 --> 00:03:42.143
The second stage would be me

00:03:42.143 --> 00:03:44.311
being able to witness it
and see it for myself

00:03:44.311 --> 00:03:46.764
and then when you just hear on the news...

00:03:46.764 --> 00:03:50.092
Here are some sanctions
being implemented by these...

00:03:50.092 --> 00:03:53.105
These people that have
very little humanity in them.

00:03:53.105 --> 00:03:56.243
[John Bolton] Iran, that's one of
the reasons why the Iranian economy

00:03:56.243 --> 00:03:59.129
is tanking right now
and we're gonna ramp this up.

00:03:59.129 --> 00:04:00.679
This is gonna be a big squeeze.

00:04:00.679 --> 00:04:03.678
That's what President Trump means
when he says, "Maximum pressure."

00:04:03.678 --> 00:04:07.724
WOMAN: Nowadays people in my country
aren't happy as usual

00:04:08.643 --> 00:04:11.032
because of the bad situation
that we (have).

00:04:11.328 --> 00:04:13.009
Like what are the conversations at home?

00:04:13.009 --> 00:04:16.825
Do you guys try to avoid all this stuff
or you talk about it all the time?

00:04:16.825 --> 00:04:18.506
Talk about it all the time.

00:04:19.005 --> 00:04:20.539
But when you hear a guy talk about it

00:04:20.539 --> 00:04:24.763
and it might sound good when
you're that far detached from humanity

00:04:25.391 --> 00:04:28.783
but the reality on the ground...

00:04:29.678 --> 00:04:34.291
I think he even has enough of a heart
or could overcome his ego enough

00:04:34.291 --> 00:04:36.665
if he sat on a bench in Tehran

00:04:36.989 --> 00:04:40.027
and noticed
the differences after sanctions.

00:04:40.570 --> 00:04:42.459
Might not feel so proud.

00:04:42.880 --> 00:04:46.368
I didn't think we would end up like this.

00:04:48.317 --> 00:04:50.976
Because of the state of Iran right now...

00:04:50.976 --> 00:04:54.431
Exactly because
it's really difficult to live.

00:04:54.464 --> 00:04:59.564
I hope this brings awareness
to Americans or foreigners

00:04:59.564 --> 00:05:02.617
that Iranians are
feeling the hurt right now

00:05:02.617 --> 00:05:06.870
and Iranians, I want you to know that...

00:05:08.191 --> 00:05:10.310
You don't need
to hear it from me, obviously.

00:05:10.310 --> 00:05:11.961
Persian culture has been through a lot.

00:05:11.961 --> 00:05:16.434
It's been through challenges
for thousands of years and...

00:05:16.434 --> 00:05:17.714
[inhales deeply]

00:05:17.740 --> 00:05:20.952
You will overcome
whatever comes at you right now

00:05:20.952 --> 00:05:26.982
and know that all Americans
or Westerners, if they knew your situation

00:05:26.982 --> 00:05:29.755
would be with you 100% because

00:05:30.484 --> 00:05:37.223
nobody likes to see others unjustly get
manipulated and maneuvered like this.

00:05:37.626 --> 00:05:42.934
Sanctions, John Bolton, Donald Trump,
you can sound tough, you can sound cool...

00:05:43.425 --> 00:05:44.473
It's not cool.

00:05:44.473 --> 00:05:46.157
It's nothing to be proud of.

00:05:46.157 --> 00:05:51.840
It's not anything to stand on
when you ruin people's lives.

00:05:53.369 --> 00:05:54.373
[claps]

00:05:54.373 --> 00:05:55.373
That's it.

00:05:58.404 --> 00:06:00.491
PETER: That was video, I tricked you.

00:06:00.491 --> 00:06:01.611
[all laughing]

00:06:01.833 --> 00:06:03.513
Do you hate Americans?

00:06:04.257 --> 00:06:05.621
[all] No!

00:06:06.049 --> 00:06:07.764
PETER: Are you sure? Are you sure?

00:06:07.764 --> 00:06:09.091
-Yes.
-Really?

00:06:09.091 --> 00:06:13.648
WOMAN: It goes behind
hating American people

00:06:14.004 --> 00:06:16.871
and we love all the people
around the world.

00:06:20.449 --> 00:06:22.129
MAN: Thank you, Peter.

00:06:22.944 --> 00:06:25.095
[applause fades into John Bolton speaking]

00:06:25.095 --> 00:06:27.954
[Bolton] The President's policy here
is maximum pressure

00:06:27.954 --> 00:06:31.757
and I think what he means
by maximum pressure is maximum pressure.

00:06:31.757 --> 00:06:35.278
The aim is to drive
Iranian oil exports to zero.

00:06:35.278 --> 00:06:36.712
[Bolton fades into Peter speaking]

00:06:36.712 --> 00:06:38.445
I'm sorry, it's just um...

00:06:38.961 --> 00:06:40.321
We are sorry too.

00:06:40.374 --> 00:06:42.441
We are sorry for our situation.

00:06:43.419 --> 00:06:46.490
[Bolton] Let's be clear, we're gonna
have sanctions that even go beyond this.

00:06:46.490 --> 00:06:49.889
We're not simply gonna be content
with the level of sanctions that

00:06:49.889 --> 00:06:51.808
existed under Obama in 2015.

00:06:52.472 --> 00:06:54.991
More are coming
and even more important perhaps

00:06:54.991 --> 00:06:58.466
we are actually going to have
very strict, very tight enforcement

00:06:58.466 --> 00:07:00.184
of the sanctions that do exist.

00:07:00.184 --> 00:07:02.681
Iran right now is in
the escape and evasion mode.

00:07:02.681 --> 00:07:04.881
They're gonna try
and get around the sanctions.

00:07:04.881 --> 00:07:06.366
We're determined to prevent that.

00:07:06.366 --> 00:07:08.046
♪ guitar and harmonica ♪

00:07:08.758 --> 00:07:10.438
[skateboard clacking]

00:07:31.957 --> 00:07:33.557
[audio slowly fades]

